cypher-dsl-python

An independent implementation of a Cypher query DSL in Python. It is not an official Neo4j
product. No endorsement, governance, ownership or release process has been agreed with
Neo4j, Inc.

Derived material

The AST vocabulary, the dialect names, the rendering and escaping rules and many test
scenarios derive from the Java project Neo4j Cypher-DSL,
https://github.com/neo4j/cypher-dsl, which is distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

